{"ref":"BDB, רָקַם","hw":"רָקַם","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">רָקַם</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. variegate (</strong>NH id.<em>;</em> so Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">رَقَمَ</span>, Ethiopic ረቀመ:, cf. 𝔗 <span dir=\"rtl\">רְקָם</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">רִקְמָתָא</span> <em>variegated cloth</em> or <em>skin</em>, Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܬܰܪܩܡܳܬܳܐ</span> <em>freckles</em><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Pt. act. <span dir=\"rtl\">רֹקֵם</span>, as subst. <em>variegator</em>, worker (weaver) in colours, c. ב mater. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 38:23\" href=\"/Exodus.38.23\">Ex 38:23</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מְלֶאכֶת חָרָשׁ וְחשֵׁב זְר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 35:35\" href=\"/Exodus.35.35\">35:35</a>; especially <span dir=\"rtl\">מַעֲשֵׂה ר׳</span> <em>variegator’s work</em> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:36\" href=\"/Exodus.26.36\">26:36</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 27:16\" href=\"/Exodus.27.16\">27:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:39\" href=\"/Exodus.28.39\">28:39</a> = <a data-ref=\"Exodus 36:37\" href=\"/Exodus.36.37\">36:37</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 38:18\" href=\"/Exodus.38.18\">38:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 39:29\" href=\"/Exodus.39.29\">39:29</a> (all P; all c. mater. except <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:39\" href=\"/Exodus.28.39\">28:39</a>).<br><strong>Pu.</strong>  Pf. 1 s. <span dir=\"rtl\">רֻקַּמְתִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 139:15\" href=\"/Psalms.139.15\">ψ 139:15</a> <em>I was skilfully wrought</em> (woven, ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">סכך</span> v <a data-ref=\"Psalms 139:13\" href=\"/Psalms.139.13\">13</a>).","next":"BDB, רִקְמָה","prev":"BDB, מִרְקַ֫חַת"}